    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The poison is particularly strong and you can't seem to shake free of it. You are <strong>&Reference[poisoned]{poisoned}</strong> for [[1d6]] days.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - After each long rest you may make a Constitution saving throw (DC equals half the damage that caused the lingering injury or 10, whichever number is higher). On a success, you are no longer <strong>poisoned</strong>. Any effect that cures poison (such as the Lesser Restoration spell) instead temporarily suppresses the poison for one hour.</p>",
